  "description": "Family Tandem\n\nThis remarkably size-adjustable tandem fits your family and friends. It also disassembles and packs into two suitcases for Airline travel. It does not fold for car travel however, that’s the Bike Friday Two’sDay. Base model starts at 43 lbs.\n\nSeeing the world as a pair, sharing the experiences and conversations together is truly the best aspect of tandem biking. Our Family Tandem is highly adjustable so you can use the same tandem as a couple and later with a young child, through to adulthood. One tandem, for the whole family!\n\nThe Family Tandem is great for cruising your town or exploring a continent with your touring companion. It disassembles, rather than folds, so it fits in the back of almost any vehicle and packs into two Travelcases for airline travel as checked luggage. If you need to fold your tandem quickly or often to fit in small spaces, the Two’sday will fit your needs well.\n\nFeatures:\n\nCustom sized to fit your body for both the Captain and the Stoker\n\nDisassembles for easy storage and transport into a space 33x37x17” (84x94x43 cm)\n\nHighly adjustable to allow different sized friends to ride with you, including kids\n\nLow step-over height easier for smaller riders to get on and off\n\nIndustry Standard Parts for ease of repair in case of emergency",
